*SPEF "IEEE 1481-1998"
*DESIGN "top2"
*DATE "now"
*VENDOR "test"
*PROGRAM "klayout-rs"
*VERSION "0.1"
*DESIGN_FLOW ""
*DIVIDER /
*DELIMITER :
*BUS_DELIMITER [ ]
*T_UNIT 1 NS
*C_UNIT 1 FF
*R_UNIT 1 OHM
*L_UNIT 1 HENRY

*NAME_MAP
*1 a
*2 b
*3 c

*D_NET *1 1.000
*CONN
*I X1:Y I
*I X2:A I
*CAP
1 *1:GROUND *2:GROUND 0.150
2 *1:GROUND *3:GROUND 0.075
*END

*D_NET *2 1.200
*CONN
*I X3:Y I
*I X4:A I
*END

*D_NET *3 0.800
*CONN
*I X5:Y I
*I X6:A I
*END
